// Title: MacOS Scripting Interpreter AppleScript
// ID: 1bc2e6c5-0885-472b-bed6-be5ea8eace55
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Alejandro Ortuno, oscd.community
// Date: 2020-10-21
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059.002
// Description: Detects execution of AppleScript of the macOS scripting language AppleScript.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where ((process.executable endswith "/osascript" and (process.command_line like "*_ -e *" or process.command_line like "*_.scpt*" or process.command_line like "*_.js*")) and not ((process.parent.executable endswith "opencode" and (process.command_line like "*_osascript*" and process.command_line like "*_ -e *" and process.command_line like "*_set imageData to the clipboard*" and process.command_line like "*_set fileRef*"))))
